      "message": "Measure whole JMdict import CPU for the validated field fusion\n\nFreeze the exact source-bound importer, work/output/runtime references, original six untimed warmups and twelve ABC blocks on each of two separately provisioned runners. Include first product module evaluation, actual worker/import work, fixed semantic probes and normal retirement in one process-wide CPU interval. Defer observer hashing and retain all original raw outputs and failures.\n\nRequire the prospectively selected 20 ms and 1% CPU savings against both stock and inactive control, at least 10 of 12 faster pairs, stable controls, and every source/output/work/activation/lifecycle check. No retries, replacements, filtering, pooling or control subtraction. This nomination screen cannot qualify a performance PR; a separate complete browser study is still required.\n\nProduct runtime is unchanged from the fully validated 01eb source. Both independent harness and original-reference reviews passed before this producer was frozen.",
